---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Freeze application configurations and independently pinned artifacts

Usage: leptoskit workspace plan [OPTIONS] --releases <RELEASES> --out <OUT>

Options:
      --manifest <MANIFEST>  Workspace manifest; otherwise locate it from the current directory
      --releases <RELEASES>  TOML release set, with versions and independently authenticated pins
      --out <OUT>            New plan file; never overwrites an existing plan
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
